  "description": "SGP8 HTCH-SYSTEM-GBR trends. All target and context sensors are selected by default. Each sensor shows use-case-specific actual and predicted values, with telemetry fallback when no predictions exist in the selected time range. Default last 24 hours (SGT).",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
